{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884670/extras/c8b879ab85f7905ac82a2b95f6ccf614.avif?t=1748063489\" width=616 height=157 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Race with Hide and seek</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat the cake before your friends without getting spotted !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not just a simple race, be careful and strategize to arrive first</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A main party game mode to play with your friends, featuring Robots to blend in and a sauce you control to eliminate your friends</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884670/extras/445214d67cc92df370e7800d255febb2.avif?t=1748063489\" width=616 height=157 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect delicious cakes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cake collection view to see and collect all the cakes you encounter during your games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >28 cakes to collect and learn more about them, associated with achievements !</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884670/extras/d98fcde959bf9e8093ffe7f36d88878f.avif?t=1748063489\" width=616 height=157 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various sub and fun modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 main sub-modes to vary gameplay, as well as many other small tweaks in Chaos mode !</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884670/extras/284b3cb29d8004c616447b9742af7d19.avif?t=1748063489\" width=616 height=157 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2 to 4 player local party game</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players locally or online with steam remote play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need only one copy of the game to invite up to 3 friends and play together online via steam !</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884670/extras/e329fa69d18fca97b839bd34f8ad0944.avif?t=1748063489\" width=616 height=157 /></span><strong>Made with love</strong>  </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made by a small indie team of only 3 people \u2764\ufe0f</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Tarte Tatin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2884670/7b9b97cfc253143ec1ccb1ec6d1b2607a8fc4da4.jpg"},{"name":"Macarons Gourmands","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2884670/fb5a1f9ff86a820d843af616a9c85645ac947cf4.jpg"},{"name":"Macarons Fruit\u00e9s","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2884670/badd5fe4da3d0d058cb5b2829fd68fa207fc0fe8.jpg"},{"name":"Salambo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2884670/8f49abe0132be0c23d8e33dd0a4363a50a518348.jpg"},{"name":"Mille-Feuille","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2884670/ad6da214c1b6760d086b441feee135a61e762da0.jpg"},{"name":"Op\u00e9ra","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2884670/09e5947b828db4d965b2a6270425a2c0b5da5c3a.jpg"},{"name":"\u00c9clair au Caf\u00e9","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2884670/e7ed5620390e247f5e46e81283788904489b3d98.jpg"},{"name":"\u00c9clair \u00e0 la pistache","path":"https:/